<title>JAPAN: Japan Sept domestic WPI down 0.8 pct yr/yr - BOJ.</title>
<headline>Japan Sept domestic WPI down 0.8 pct yr/yr - BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's domestic wholesale price index, a key component of overall WPI, was down 0.8 percent in September from a year earlier, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The following is a detailed breakdown of the September WPI:</p>
<p>Year-on-year (in percent)</p>
<p>	    September    August</p>
<p> Overall   0.0	   +0.5</p>
<p> Domestic -0.8	   -0.7</p>
<p> Exports  +1.9	   +5.0</p>
<p> Imports  +7.4	  +10.3</p>
<p>Month-on-month (in percent, index base year 1990):</p>
<p>	    September    August  Index</p>
<p> Overall  +0.1	   -0.2    92.7</p>
<p> Domestic -0.1	    0.0    95.2</p>
<p> Exports  +0.7	   -0.9    85.2</p>
<p> Imports  +1.0	   -0.6    79.7</p>
</text>
